          "id": 3185140219,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "There's a difference between heuristic functions and heuristic \"protocols\".  Many protocols have a \"deterministic\" function as well as a \"heuristic\" one and I believe the \"Enable protocols\" dialog aims at the proto_id, regardless of the function(s) it uses to be enabled.",
